  "name": "Vaults of the Inquisition: no creature sinks through the floor on any difficulty",
  "contract": [
    "Vaults of the Inquisition (map 936) runs on the VMaps and MMaps built 2026-10-29. Every creature and",
    "gameobject spawn of the map is audited against the VMap floor under it; its rows are findings to triage, since",
    "hovering creatures sit above the floor by design. Then a level 60 player with 5,000,000 health enters on",
    "Normal, Heroic and Mythic, is teleported to every creature cluster in turn so the packs aggro and chase it",
    "along the navigation mesh, and finally waits at the entrance while they evade home. No loaded living creature",
    "may then stand more than 3 yards under the floor below the higher of its current and spawn height, or over no",
    "floor at all: that is a mob that fell through the ground."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 600000,
